<title>UK: Lehman sets warrants on Porsche AG.</title>
<headline>Lehman sets warrants on Porsche AG.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lehman Brothers Finance S.A. has issued five million American-style call warrants, in four equal tranches, on Porsche AG preferred stock, lead manager Lehman Brothers Bankhaus AG said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> PAYDATE	   23.JAN.97		 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, STUTT, DUSS    SPOT REF     1375 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	    MATURITY    STRIKE    ISSUE     PREMIUM  GEARING</p>
<p> SPRINTER I    19.SEP.97   1250 DEM  2.63 DEM  10.04 PCT 5.23 X</p>
<p> SPRINTER II   19.SEP.97   1350 DEM  2.12 DEM  13.60 PCT 6.49 X</p>
<p> MARATHON III  15.JAN.99   1350 DEM  3.50 DEM  23.64 PCT 3.93 X</p>
<p> MARATHON IV   15.JAN.99   1450 DEM  3.10 DEM  28.00 PCT 4.44 X</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
